## Expected

As in InDesign (Document Footnote Options > Layout > Span Footnotes Across Columns): the footnote area runs the full width of the text frame, below all its columns, and each column's text ends above it.

## Actual

The footnote rule and text sit under the first column only and wrap at the column width. `spanColumns: false` renders the same page.

